      "task": {
        "task": "Fix DataFrame.duplicated() to preserve the index for DataFrames with no columns, allowing its result to be used as a boolean indexer.",
        "subtasks": [
          "Update the empty-frame path in DataFrame.duplicated() to return a boolean Series filled with False and indexed by self.index.",
          "Add a regression test for DataFrame(index=[0, 1]) verifying the returned Series and that df[df.duplicated()] equals df.iloc[:0]; ensure the existing empty-frame test still passes.",
          "Document the fix in the pandas 3.1.0 release notes under Indexing, referencing issue #61191."
        ]
      },
      "agent_task": "Task: Fix DataFrame.duplicated() to preserve the index for DataFrames with no columns, allowing its result to be used as a boolean indexer.\n\nSubtasks:\n- Update the empty-frame path in DataFrame.duplicated() to return a boolean Series filled with False and indexed by self.index.\n- Add a regression test for DataFrame(index=[0, 1]) verifying the returned Series and that df[df.duplicated()] equals df.iloc[:0]; ensure the existing empty-frame test still passes.\n- Document the fix in the pandas 3.1.0 release notes under Indexing, referencing issue #61191.",
